<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96222" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταλαγ-μός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dropping, dripping</i>, from the
			mouth of horses and hunted animals, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				247
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				783
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					241
				</span></i>
			 (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ion</u>
					351
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				1003
			</span></i> (pl.); of a profuse sweat, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.85
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.140
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ς. κατατρίβει τοὺς λίθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					253b15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίονες πεπήγασιν ἀπό τινων
			ς</span>., of stalactites, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				834b32
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμύρνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					370
				</span></i>
			 (pl.): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εἰρήνης</span>
			<i>the least drop</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1033
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύχης ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Diog.Sinop.
				2
			</span></i>; contemptuously of a little man, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				34.3
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταλαγμούς</span> is unmetrical
			in <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				966
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταλαημούς</span> cj. Koechly,
			cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταλεηδόνες</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
